      "content": "that's a pretty intense way to look at it. but if the goal is just social justice or \"uncomfortable truths,\" then doesn't that basically turn art into just another form of propaganda? if technical skill doesn't matter anymore, why should anyone care about the work itself rather than just the slogan behind it?",
